    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3849670/extras/2e09c001d3bca9a71fdf239a646afa25.avif?t=1754001762\" width=800 height=308 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Infinity Toweris a fast-paced and addictive 3D platformer where every second counts. Your mission: climb to the top of a giant tower as quickly as possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A CHALLENGE AGAINS GRAVITY AWAITS YOU :</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>each floor of the tower is filled with devious traps and unpredictable obstacles that will put your agility to the test. Every jump matters, as a single mistake could send you all the way back to the start. And be warned: the timer starts the moment you take your first step! The faster you climb, the more impressive your performance. Try to beat your personal best\u2026 or the times of other players.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3849670/extras/7faca9d1ca92958c7179c20a2283f5b7.poster.avif?t=1754001762\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3849670/extras/7faca9d1ca92958c7179c20a2283f5b7.webm?t=1754001762\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3849670/extras/7faca9d1ca92958c7179c20a2283f5b7.mp4?t=1754001762\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>COLLECT THE HIDDEN BOLTS :</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Bolts are scattered throughout the tower, often in the most hard-to-reach places. Can you collect them all without losing precious time?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3849670/extras/71b84eed1ba211916d3ac944ffc1511a.poster.avif?t=1754001762\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3849670/extras/71b84eed1ba211916d3ac944ffc1511a.webm?t=1754001762\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3849670/extras/71b84eed1ba211916d3ac944ffc1511a.mp4?t=1754001762\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3849670/extras/2e09c001d3bca9a71fdf239a646afa25.avif?t=1754001762\" width=800 height=308 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Infinity Toweris a fast-paced and addictive 3D platformer where every second counts. Your mission: climb to the top of a giant tower as quickly as possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A CHALLENGE AGAINS GRAVITY AWAITS YOU :</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>each floor of the tower is filled with devious traps and unpredictable obstacles that will put your agility to the test. Every jump matters, as a single mistake could send you all the way back to the start. And be warned: the timer starts the moment you take your first step! The faster you climb, the more impressive your performance. Try to beat your personal best\u2026 or the times of other players.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3849670/extras/7faca9d1ca92958c7179c20a2283f5b7.poster.avif?t=1754001762\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3849670/extras/7faca9d1ca92958c7179c20a2283f5b7.webm?t=1754001762\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3849670/extras/7faca9d1ca92958c7179c20a2283f5b7.mp4?t=1754001762\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>COLLECT THE HIDDEN BOLTS :</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Bolts are scattered throughout the tower, often in the most hard-to-reach places. Can you collect them all without losing precious time?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3849670/extras/71b84eed1ba211916d3ac944ffc1511a.poster.avif?t=1754001762\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3849670/extras/71b84eed1ba211916d3ac944ffc1511a.webm?t=1754001762\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3849670/extras/71b84eed1ba211916d3ac944ffc1511a.mp4?t=1754001762\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
